OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure plans blamed on    
OL,4,Afalling birth rates                    
OL,6,FFour schools in Norfolk could close or 
OL,7,Fmerge due to a decline in pupil numbers
OL,8,Fblamed on falling birth rates.         
OL,10,FNorfolk County Council has proposed    
OL,11,Fmerging three of the schools with      
OL,12,Fexisting ones nearby and closing one   
OL,13,Fcompletely. The schools affected are   
OL,14,FNorthrepps Primary School, Erpingham   
OL,15,FPrimary School, Walpole Highway Primary
OL,16,FSchool and Terrington St John Primary  
OL,17,FSchool.                                
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
