OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure plans blamed on    
OL,4,Afalling birth rates                    
OL,6,FThe council said the changes are       
OL,7,Fnecessary as pupil numbers are expected
OL,8,Fto continue to fall and there is       
OL,9,Falready a surplus of primary school    
OL,10,Fplaces, predominantly in rural areas.  
OL,12,FOlivia Morris, Reform deputy cabinet   
OL,13,Fmember for children, said the          
OL,14,Fauthority's priority is to "ensure     
OL,15,Fchildren receive a good education".    
